    "detailed_description": "<strong>Antbox</strong> is a short sandbox game about observing ants.<br><br>Ants leave the nest in search of food to bring home. They leave pheremone trails to help others find their way to discovered food and to alert others that danger is near.<br><br>You can customize the ants' abilities and behavior to your liking.<br><br>Challenges to the ants' survival include food scarcity, predators, and rival ant colonies. Customize rivals and see which colony performs the best.",
